Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.06,0:00:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time the rain no longer falls, and I\Nsee the sky, I think the rain is falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.98,0:00:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Back to when I was a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.36,0:00:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could only cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.02,0:00:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Blindly chasing after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.58,0:00:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I fell far behind my only thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.40,0:00:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,One day I will be stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.46,0:00:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Bridery and gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.98,0:00:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Fading with the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.58,0:00:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I stronger now than I was before?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.40,0:00:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Or as weak as back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.38,0:00:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.48,0:01:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But until I do, my voyage will not end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.24,0:01:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what's next, I'm\Nwalking straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.06,0:01:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go, there's nothing\Nthat can stop us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.66,0:01:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Though time's all on our side,\Nwe'll never let it pull us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And we may fall, but we'll\Nalways keep on standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.66,0:01:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way anything\Nwill take what I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.28,0:01:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The voices inside me push\Nme to keep surviving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.76,0:01:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go on. I'll get through.\NNo matter what, I gotta do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.34,0:01:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The fiercest storms of\Nall can pour upon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.26,0:01:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care why in the\Nworld would I turn back?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.78,0:01:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.94,0:01:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,there's nothing that can stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.76,0:02:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The tides that are on our side\Nwill never let it pull us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.92,0:02:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And we may fall, but we'll\Nalways keep on standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.98,0:02:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way anything will take\Nwhat I hold dear away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.18,0:02:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the future's there for us to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.04,0:02:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This Marine Ford business\Nis gonna change the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.12,0:02:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's true after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.00,0:02:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The news spread like wildfire falling on\Nears that could scarcely believe the words.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.54,0:02:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace, son of the great gold Roger, fell\Nin battle alongside Whitebeard. Extra!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.86,0:02:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready to issue an extra!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.08,0:02:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We just received some breaking news.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.64,0:02:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard was killed\Nshortly after Firefist Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.84,0:02:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,and the Marines have claimed victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.40,0:02:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He's really dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.28,0:02:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.19,0:02:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.11,0:02:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This crew is done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.46,0:02:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,There's peace again!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.64,0:03:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If the Navy can take care of Whitebeard!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.84,0:03:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the rest of the pirates will follow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.90,0:03:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,While many celebrated,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.82,0:03:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,those who saw these events unfold\Nwith their own eyes stand transfixed,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.18,0:03:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,their mouths agape,?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.94,0:03:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,words frozen on their lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.72,0:03:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage, Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.28,0:03:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,His name was Edward Newgate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.56,0:03:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,In his prime, he stood against\Neven the king of the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.22,0:03:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,His crew was his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.54,0:03:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And he fought beside them\Ninto the ripe old age of 72.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.84,0:03:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The world knew him as Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.50,0:03:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He had stepped boldly into\NMarineford and brought
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.66,0:03:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,the walls of the Navy\Nheadquarters down around him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.16,0:03:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, despite his superhuman efforts,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.24,0:03:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,the Navy forces, aided\Nby the Seven Warlords,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.08,0:03:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,proved too strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.64,0:03:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, what a day!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.38,0:04:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the birth of a new world,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.28,0:04:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,or the death of an old one I think today's\Nparty may have some life in it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.30,0:04:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.66,0:04:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Marco, for what it's worth,\Nwe all share your sentiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.98,0:04:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's not the time for revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.78,0:04:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I get it. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.52,0:04:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Save your tears and hurry up, you fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.00,0:04:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't forgotten your\Ncaptain's final orders, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.38,0:04:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No distractions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.78,0:04:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be setting sail\Nas quickly as we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.02,0:04:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.60,0:04:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That old Carter was tough as nails.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.88,0:04:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought he'd never die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.46,0:04:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A minor delay, yes, but\Nscarcely unexpected.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.14,0:04:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now for the fun part.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.90,0:04:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's give them a magic\Nshow they'll never forget!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.78,0:04:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, who knows\Nwhat they're planning!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.30,0:04:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.44,0:04:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't you done enough to Pops?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.64,0:05:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch carefully, it's a good trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.54,0:05:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So good, in fact, it's gonna shake\Nthe whole world down to its core!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.54,0:05:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever this is, it's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.66,0:05:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he doing something to\NWhitebeard's corpse in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.62,0:05:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.82,0:05:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're curious, but\Nplease don't interrupt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.72,0:05:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get too cocky, pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.46,0:05:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He joined the seven warlords\Njust so he could betray us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.32,0:05:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever he's up to, you\Ncan bet it won't be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.26,0:05:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.92,0:05:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So what happens if this plan\Ndoesn't work? We disband.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.90,0:05:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.81,0:05:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.80,0:05:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.71,0:05:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do you think, stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.52,0:05:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Someplace far away from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.36,0:05:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,My plan to kill Whitebeard\Nis shot, obviously!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.34,0:05:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So we're running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.72,0:06:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so close!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.84,0:06:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm scared! I admit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.16,0:06:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather dig a hole, crawl in,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.94,0:06:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and live the rest of my measurable\Nlife in there than face this guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.28,0:06:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care if you think\NI'm pathetic, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.04,0:06:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need you losers around anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.36,0:06:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy! He's crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.88,0:06:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it our fault? Aha!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.90,0:06:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's teaching us a lesson about sympathy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.12,0:06:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeing Whitebeard\Nsuffering filled him with
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.98,0:06:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,pity and humanity triumphed over savagery.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.52,0:06:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.43,0:06:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,His message is engraved upon my soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.86,0:06:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but he laughed, fearing\Nwe wouldn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.26,0:06:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He had a shot at fame and fortune,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.74,0:06:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,but he understood that the cost of his
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.32,0:06:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,personal integrity was\Na price too high to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.02,0:06:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Because material gains\Nare ultimately meaningless
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.32,0:06:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,and public acclaim is fleeting\Nin these trying times.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.40,0:06:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen the light, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.86,0:06:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as if I've been reborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.60,0:06:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Share more of your wisdom with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.50,0:06:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared for knowledge. Go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.00,0:06:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.24,0:07:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.14,0:07:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy I know it hurts right now but you\Nmust carry on for in a world without
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.80,0:07:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,ace your courage will be needed tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.36,0:07:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,and every day after fire it's a heavy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.52,0:07:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,weight but one I'm confident you can bear\NJinbe. I know I might not make it out
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.32,0:07:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,of this alive I'm sorry but if I die
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.62,0:07:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you look after my brother for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.78,0:07:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear you misjudge my character, Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.60,0:07:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean no disrespect, but I may\Nnot be as charitable as you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.50,0:07:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm certain you care for your brother,\Nbut we live in a world of pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.78,0:07:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I offer my aid to those\NI hold in high regard?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.94,0:07:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,but only to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.38,0:07:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got room on this ship over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.48,0:07:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.46,0:07:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.56,0:08:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.52,0:08:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And we were so close, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.28,0:08:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean we're stuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.58,0:08:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we've gotta do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.54,0:08:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Aokiji's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.45,0:08:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.98,0:08:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to run! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.40,0:08:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you really think you\Ncould get away from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.08,0:08:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you save yourself some\Ntrouble and let me kill you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.98,0:08:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand over dragons, son, and\NI may decide to spare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.84,0:08:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Akainu, I thought Pops killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.40,0:08:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But how did he survive the fall?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.70,0:08:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he come out of the ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.50,0:08:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,His lava powers freak me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.08,0:08:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Team bane a generous offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.26,0:09:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,but I must refuse you\Naren't the only tenacious
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.96,0:09:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,One here, I've decided\Nto protect this boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.94,0:09:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter the cost have it your way then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.00,0:09:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't ask twice
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.62,0:09:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna lay a\Nfinger on Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.12,0:09:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,wanted us to protect him\Nuseless cowards out of my way
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.22,0:09:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Through Empire. Faceproof Synthesis!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.92,0:09:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If I may, I believe I can\Nbe of assistance here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.66,0:09:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Great Scissors!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.00,0:09:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep those magma-covered paws\Nof yours off of Straw Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.42,0:09:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This kid is history, and\Nhis father will be next!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.26,0:09:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell wing ga!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.42,0:09:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been pushing\Nhimself since Impel Down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.50,0:10:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He's passed his limit\Nphysically and emotionally.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.00,0:10:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a wonder he's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.08,0:10:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,One more hiccup and we could lose him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.60,0:10:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If something were to happen on my watch,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.12,0:10:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I could never show my giant\Nface to his father again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.20,0:10:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,As Dragon's comrade, it's my\Nduty to protect his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.08,0:10:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.14,0:10:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you're hot stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.06,0:10:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You ain't seen nothing yet, Magma Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.10,0:10:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.01,0:10:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Because this queen is on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.60,0:10:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, mostly gentlemen,\Nwe are grateful for your patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.96,0:10:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Teach and his merry men\Npresent to you a stunning spectacle,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.80,0:10:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,the likes of which you've never seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.34,0:10:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two... Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.86,0:10:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What did he do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.68,0:11:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He was doing something in there, but what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.80,0:11:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The Whitebeard's body looks the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.56,0:11:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Blackbeard's too, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.62,0:11:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.94,0:11:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.26,0:11:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The Warlord thing, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.22,0:11:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You played your part well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.00,0:11:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But as you'll see I\Ndon't need you anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.20,0:11:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This one here you all know it's my\Ndark dark fruit power, but this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.08,0:11:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.32,0:11:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.38,0:12:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,An earthquake?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.04,0:12:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the power of the Tremor Fruit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.28,0:12:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought if you had two\Ntelephone powers you would die,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.12,0:12:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,and how did you take them for\NWhitebeard in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.28,0:12:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you pulled it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.48,0:12:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He stole that power from Pops!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.90,0:12:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, but how?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.34,0:12:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That isn't normal, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.44,0:12:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A hand of darkness to call forth the void.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.38,0:12:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A hand of light to shake the\Nheavens and rend the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.28,0:12:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Both are mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.78,0:12:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And the world will tremble\Nwith my every step.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.88,0:13:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Only a fool would dare defy me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.58,0:13:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how he did it, but he did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.38,0:13:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't fake having a power like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.94,0:13:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But does he know that we don't? Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.14,0:13:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Young, we beat Whitebeard, but so what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.64,0:13:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's even worse than before! But hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.60,0:13:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought if you tried to get\Na second Devil Fruit power,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.98,0:13:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,then your body would, like, blow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.16,0:13:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, for normal people,\Nthat's how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.24,0:13:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know as well as I do\Nthat teaches anything but normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.96,0:13:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And with that body of his, he can pull\Na trick we couldn't even dream of.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.26,0:13:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He's probably been planning\Nthis thing for ages now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.36,0:13:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Got your attention now, Z!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.00,0:13:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a wake-up call to all the boring\Npeace-lovers, the half-assed pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.30,0:13:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,the fat-headed fools in world\Ngovernment, the ignorant masses.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.06,0:13:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.22,0:13:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It just has to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.50,0:13:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We all must answer to the hand of fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.18,0:14:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And fate has chosen me\Nto conquer this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.26,0:14:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Seal's coming down!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.16,0:14:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.08,0:14:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Abandon your balls!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.02,0:14:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.24,0:14:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.34,0:14:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing left.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.58,0:14:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The pirates, they took everything we had.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.42,0:14:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Our citadel where we've watched\Nover these waters for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.18,0:14:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all crumbling down. The\Nsymbol of the Navy's strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.90,0:14:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a nightmare
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.22,0:14:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn he planned this from\Nthe very start didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.42,0:15:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He betrayed Whitebeard, captured\NAce, and became a warlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.44,0:15:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,All the force them into this battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.84,0:15:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright then, take a good luck. Cuz you\Nain't seen nothing like this before?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.88,0:15:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't stop him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.72,0:15:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.00,0:15:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hardly blame them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.22,0:15:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be crying too if my\Nenemies had this kind of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.98,0:15:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.08,0:15:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Took some time, but this\Nis a hell of a payoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.48,0:15:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I got the whole world wrapped\Naround my finger you bastard
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.08,0:15:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.44,0:15:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't want to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.50,0:15:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm right here
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.42,0:15:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If you let me get away\Nwho knows what I might do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.62,0:15:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I warned ya
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.70,0:16:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now where to start?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.86,0:16:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.66,0:16:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How about I give\NMarineford a burial at sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.72,0:16:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't dare!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.10,0:16:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Sarkwave!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.70,0:16:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You can tear down our buildings,\Nbut in time we will rebuild them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.00,0:16:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But this island is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.24,0:17:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's more than a symbol of our strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.50,0:17:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It stands in the center of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.30,0:17:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.02,0:17:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And that means if we\Nwant to protect innocent
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.62,0:17:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,people from criminals such as yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.34,0:17:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,it must be our stronghold, so\Nits light can reach every corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.90,0:17:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Compassion is justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.66,0:17:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It defies chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.80,0:17:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't perish, and it will\Ncertainly not sink by your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.22,0:17:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn to learn your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.84,0:17:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's a downright noble\Nsentiment, compassion or what have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.64,0:17:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.30,0:17:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see what you're made of.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.28,0:18:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.10,0:18:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We bought you some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.90,0:18:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.36,0:18:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.96,0:18:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.36,0:18:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad move, Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.18,0:18:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.50,0:18:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a pesky one, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.12,0:18:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Nu-kama-ken-po, aesthetic technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.72,0:18:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This one's my fat suctioning fist.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.48,0:18:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I like it hot, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.86,0:18:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't a game dammit get the\Nhell out of my way or pay the price
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.20,0:19:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.96,0:19:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare, Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.12,0:19:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd be wise to run while you\Ncan. I have no business with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.78,0:19:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I dare not face him on dry\Nland, but the sea will aid me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.28,0:19:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The water, it's frozen solid!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.12,0:19:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, Aokiji!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.44,0:19:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Here he comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.12,0:19:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Nowhere left to run, you bloated fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.64,0:19:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm helpless then!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.46,0:19:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand him over!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.12,0:19:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm putting an end to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.16,0:20:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like it went\Nstraight through him it might
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.76,0:20:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,have been Straw Hat and\Nthey're falling fast too
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.94,0:20:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Still have some fight left in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.24,0:20:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.68,0:20:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.26,0:20:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that I couldn't uphold my vow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.02,0:20:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You might have saved yourself instead\Nof condemning the both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.46,0:20:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If you keep making me miss,\Nit won't be good for anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.42,0:20:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,A blow to the heart would\Nbe quick and painless.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.22,0:20:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Better than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.16,0:21:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The boy's got a hole in his chest You\Nsure you still want to protect him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.04,0:21:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You know he's gonna die either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.18,0:21:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to let him perish.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.92,0:21:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He protected us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.40,0:21:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't be up there long.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.32,0:21:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So catch them when they fall\Nand put them on our ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.72,0:21:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the sudden change of heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.58,0:21:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I say if you're going to protect\Nsomeone then do it right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.82,0:22:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like either of you, but if you\Nscrew this up, then you'll let the Navy win!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.38,0:22:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I blew it, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.38,0:22:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You had so much faith in me, but I was\Nnothing more than a coward all along!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.28,0:22:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just float away somewhere\Nand find a hole to crawl in,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.98,0:22:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,because the only thing I'm\Nthe king of is to survive it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.46,0:22:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh crap, you're getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.70,0:22:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,They're stuck in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.00,0:22:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's happening here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.94,0:22:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice catch, Captain Page!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.92,0:22:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved Straw Hat and Jimmy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.26,0:22:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I never should have doubted you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.16,0:22:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He wasn't running!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.88,0:22:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He was just looking out for Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.98,0:22:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Because all the glory in the world means
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.08,0:22:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,nothing compared to the\Nlife of an old friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.94,0:22:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.76,0:22:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,His heart's as pure as a baby lamb! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.66,0:22:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hear what they're\Nsaying, but I bet it's stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.34,0:22:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Jinbe?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.56,0:22:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.60,0:23:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.16,0:23:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you idiots doing\Nall the way up here,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.48,0:23:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,and why are you both covered in blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.12,0:23:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This is weird, even for you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.98,0:23:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, is it just me, or is it hot?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.32,0:23:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.23,0:23:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Madmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.66,0:23:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, my red-nosed friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.84,0:23:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.44,0:23:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.72,0:23:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even know what's\Ngoing on right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.66,0:23:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I allowed Luffy to be harmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.86,0:23:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We must find a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.48,0:23:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He was burned quite badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.62,0:23:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.08,0:23:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And good luck finding a doctor\Nin the middle of this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.94,0:23:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to trump the both of you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.62,0:23:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, were you making fun of my nose?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.94,0:23:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How many people do I have to\Ngo through to finish that brat?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.44,0:23:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Rolls Rundle!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.10,0:23:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're fools, each and every one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.90,0:23:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Is one boy so damned important that\Nyou're willing to throw your lives away?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.28,0:24:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You may mock us if you please,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.64,0:24:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,but there is a strength\Nin Straw Hat's tenacity
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.04,0:24:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,that may prove invaluable to this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.50,0:24:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Pop spent his life on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.38,0:24:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He has to carry on Ace's legacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.18,0:24:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the dawn of a new era, and\Nwe have a duty to see him through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.18,0:24:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Noble sentiment from a bunch of criminals,\Nbut in the end, it's just empty talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.34,0:24:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't hesitate to strike you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.36,0:24:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.70,0:24:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Your insistence on killing Straw Hat\Njust proves to us how much you fear him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.38,0:24:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And if a tough guy like you\Nis scared of a boy like him,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.32,0:24:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,that means he's worth protecting.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.16,0:24:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,To the death, if need be!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.42,0:24:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, can't you jackasses do\Nanything without my help?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.28,0:24:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you even listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.10,0:24:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't just pass out, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.60,0:24:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I didn't need it, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.24,0:24:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't die on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.24,0:24:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you gotta tell me where to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.08,0:24:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm lost here. Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.70,0:25:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankly, I should be applauding\Nhim for making Straw Hat suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.90,0:25:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But I suppose the pirate in me\Nwould rather punch him in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.54,0:25:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I see that trying to reason\Nwith you is a lost cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.62,0:25:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Have it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.36,0:25:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.18,0:25:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Sengoku versus Blackbeard over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.78,0:25:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's Aka-Inu versus the\Ncommanders on that side.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.52,0:25:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought this war was\Nsupposed to be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.00,0:25:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy, do something, anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.14,0:26:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got my hands full, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.24,0:26:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.60,0:26:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It was underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.32,0:26:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,A ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.34,0:26:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a submarine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.66,0:26:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a Charlie Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.98,0:26:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.89,0:26:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't take orders from you, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.14,0:26:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides, what do you want\Nwith him anyway, you weirdo?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.78,0:26:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.98,0:26:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat may be my enemy someday, but\NI'll let the fates decide that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.60,0:26:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, it'd be a\Nwaste to let him die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.64,0:26:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand him over and we can escape.
